#: ../../functions/func_setmulti.rst:6
msgid "$setmulti"
msgstr ""

#: ../../functions/func_setmulti.rst:8
msgid "Usage: **$setmulti(name,value[,separator])**"
msgstr "用法：**$setmulti(name,value[,separator])**"

#: ../../functions/func_setmulti.rst:9
msgid "Category: assignment"
msgstr "类别：赋值"

#: ../../functions/func_setmulti.rst:10
msgid "Implemented: Picard 1.0"
msgstr "实现：Picard 1.0"

#: ../../functions/func_setmulti.rst:12
msgid "**Description:**"
msgstr "**描述：**"

#: ../../functions/func_setmulti.rst:14
msgid "Sets the variable ``name`` to ``value``, using the ``separator`` (or a semicolon followed by a space \"; \" if not passed) to coerce the ``value`` back into a proper multi-valued variable. This can be used to operate on multi-valued variables as a string, and then set them back as proper multi-valued variable."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``separator``（如果没有传递，则使用分号后跟空格 \"; \"）将变量 ``name`` "
"设置为 ``value``，将 ``value`` 强制回一个正确的多值变量。这可用于将多值变量作"
"为字符串进行操作，然后将其设置回正确的多值变量。"

